wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">a workplace pensions, savings and financial wellbeing company for consideration of &#163;</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#2a2a2b;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_7f48413e-ea01-4527-ac2f-3522ab1fe6a3" contextRef="C_17f516f2-2217-4860-83cc-c82bcb7f1773" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireBusinessesGross" unitRef="U_GBP" scale="6" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">150</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#2a2a2b;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million, subject to working capital and other adjustments, and contingent consideration of up to &#163;</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#2a2a2b;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_2896c983-412b-40b4-857f-ad112d8b3a1d" contextRef="C_712f7cbd-da41-49c5-98e1-0d7b2f7016dd" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationArrangementsRangeOfOutcomesValueHigh" unitRef="U_GBP" scale="6" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">100</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#2a2a2b;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million, </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">a portion of which is expected to be recognized as compensation costs</span><span style="color:#2a2a2b;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">. </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The transaction is expected to close during the first half of 2026, subject to receipt of certain regulatory approvals and other customary closing conditions.</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Al-Futtaim Willis &#8212; </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">On May 2, 2025, the Company entered into a definitive agreement to acquire the remaining </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_75020423-7f9f-4edb-bc3d-5e97c07c22c5" contextRef="C_49c9f75c-f620-412b-b45a-e7c3f4552a21" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationStepAcquisitionEquityInterestInAcquireePercentage" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">51</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">% controlling interest of its longstanding broking joint venture, Al-Futtaim Willis (</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#8216;AFW&#8217;), based in the </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">United Arab Emirates, for cash consideration of $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_c227479a-8f07-40fa-858a-5feaf97f5728" contextRef="C_1ea43ad8-3a8e-4bf7-86f2-f2854fa27646" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireBusinessesGross" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">58</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;w