family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> The program incurred cumulative costs of $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_5d6df57a-b35b-4ccf-be61-8db679c32d53" contextRef="C_519db826-3791-41d0-9315-71cb28cbfa94" name="us-gaap:RestructuringAndRelatedCostIncurredCost" unitRef="U_USD" scale="9" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1.115</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">billion and capital expenditures of </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">$</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_54f2feaf-b048-44f5-b828-b80df5cc07c9" contextRef="C_24e8baf8-6d09-4634-b979-f4ff6a51bc0a" name="us-gaap:RestructuringAndRelatedCostIncurredCost" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">130</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">million, resulting in a total investment of $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_ebc454b8-6587-46a3-a019-e0721967b879" contextRef="C_4885b26a-bd90-4799-9774-b19d1dc88c82" name="us-gaap:RestructuringAndRelatedCostIncurredCost" unitRef