ould realize upon disposition, nor do they indicate the Company&#8217;s intent or ability to dispose of the financial instruments. The fair values of our held-to-maturity securities are considered Level 1</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p></ix:continuation></div></div>
